| Base models | `db/models/base.py:17` `BaseModel(AuditModel)`: UUID pk, created/updated by+at, soft delete via `deleted_at` (`db/mixins.py`). `db/models/project.py:180` `ProjectBaseModel` adds project + workspace FKs and derives workspace from project in `save()`. | Both new models extend `ProjectBaseModel`. |
| Uniqueness under soft delete | `unique_together=[…, "deleted_at"]` plus a `UniqueConstraint(condition=Q(deleted_at__isnull=True))` (Project L145-160). | We use the same pattern. |
