| SSRF-safe HTTP | `utils/url_security.py`: `pinned_fetch(method, url, *, allowed_ips=None, allowed_hosts=None, headers=None, timeout=30, **kwargs)` (L198). It pins the validated IP, never follows redirects and sets `trust_env=False`. `utils/ip_address.py:159` `validate_url(url, allowed_ips, allowed_hosts)` raises `ValueError`. The webhook settings pattern is in `settings/common.py:55-92`. | **Always** use `pinned_fetch`. Add `CYBERNETICS_DATA_ALLOWED_HOSTS/IPS` settings, built like the webhook ones. |
| Throttling | Only anon + asset + API-key throttles; the session-authenticated app views have **no per-user throttle**. | Add `CyberneticsDataProxyThrottle`. |
