| MCP | `plane/mcp`: tools replay calls in-process against the public `/api/v1` with the caller's API key (`mcp/client.py`). | Future MCP tools need `/api/v1` endpoints (phase 4, optional). |
| URL aggregation | `app/urls/__init__.py` imports each module's `urlpatterns`. | Add `cybernetics_data.py` there. |

