## 3. Analysis — Cybernetics-Projects frontend (`P/apps/web`)

Aliases: `@/*` → `apps/web/core/*` and `@/plane-web/*` → `apps/web/ce/*` (`apps/web/tsconfig.json`). There is no `ee` directory.

